@startuml
title launch-stop - code
component "session/launched-sessions.mjs\nstopLaunch" as Api
component "session/launch-records.mjs\nstop request, stopped state" as Records
component "session/launch-supervisor.mjs\nwatches the stop request,\ncloses the host's input" as Supervisor
component "session/launch-hosts.mjs\ninterrupt line, turn/interrupt" as Hosts
component "Host process\nClaude Code stream-json input\nor Codex app-server" as Host
Api --> Records : write stop request
Supervisor --> Records : read request, record end
Supervisor --> Hosts : interrupt message
Supervisor --> Host : interrupt, close input
Supervisor ..> Host : forced end after the grace period
@enduml
